DESCRIPTION:Alternative Medicine is an absurdist sketch comedy group hailin
 g from New York City featuring Marty Chandler\, Colleen Granberg\, Brian Ma
 rtin\, Sofia Pastena\, Katie Redden and Patrick Walsh. In 2025\, they held 
 a sold-out eight-month residency at NYC’s The PIT\, and made their off-Br
 oadway debut at The Theater Center (NYC). You can find them at major comedy
  clubs in NYC such as: Caveat\, The PIT and Brooklyn Comedy Collective. Mr 
 Show meets Monty Python meets a secret third thing. Alternative Medicine is
  written with\, and produced by\, Spencer Giles and directed by Jason Tyus 
 Smith.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/alternative-m
 edicine/
